      "body": "<div><span style=\"font-size: 13px;\"><b>**This is an automated reply confirming we received your email/request.**</b></span></div><div><br /></div><div><b><span style=\"font-family: &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, &quot;Segoe UI&quot;, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 13px;\">Access our new attorney portal to e-sign liens, view bills, balances, reports, images and pay online @ <a href=\"http://precise.radflow360.com/\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">Precise.RadFlow360.com</a></span></b></div><div><br /></div><div><span style=\"font-family: 'Helvetica Neue', 'Segoe UI', Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 13px; font-weight: 400;\">Please allow </span><span style=\"font-family: 'Helvetica Neue', 'Segoe UI', Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 13px;\"><b>three</b></span><span style=\"font-family: 'Helvetica Neue', 'Segoe UI', Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 13px; font-weight: 400;\"> </span><span style=\"font-family: 'Helvetica Neue', 'Segoe UI', Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 13px;\"><b><u>full</u></b></span><span style=\"font-family: 'Helvetica Neue', 'Segoe UI', Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 13px; font-weight: 400;\"> business days for a response. (Business hours: Mon-Fri 9am-5pm).</span></div><div><span style=\"font-family: 'Helvetica Neue', 'Segoe UI', Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 13px; font-weight: 400;\"><br /></span></div><div><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\"><b style=\"font-style: inherit; color: rgb(29, 28, 29); font-family: Slack-Lato, appleLogo, sans-serif;\" data-stringify-type=\"bold\" class=\"fa-31vw68 facty68n\">If you do not receive a response within the&nbsp;</b><b style=\"font-style: inherit; color: rgb(29, 28, 29); font-family: Slack-Lato, appleLogo, sans-serif;\" data-stringify-type=\"bold\" class=\"fa-31vw68 facty68n\"><i data-stringify-type=\"italic\">allotted</i></b><b style=\"font-style: inherit; color: rgb(29, 28, 29); font-family: Slack-Lato, appleLogo, sans-serif;\" data-stringify-type=\"bold\" class=\"fa-31vw68 facty68n\">&nbsp;time, please call to follow up on your email/request.</b><b>&nbsp;</b></span></div><div><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\"><b><br /></b></span></div><div><u><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\"><b>New address for mailing payments:</b></span></u></div><div><br /></div><div><b>Precise Imaging</b></div><div><b>PO Box 510626</b></div><div><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\"><b>Livonia MI 48151<br /></b></span></div><div><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\"><b><br /></b></span></div><div style=\"margin-left: 7em;\"><u><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\"><b>IMPORTANT INFO BEFORE SUBMITTING PAYMENT</b></span></u></div><div><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\"><b><br /></b></span></div><ol data-front-editor-list style=\"margin-top: 0px; margin-bottom: 0px; list-style-type: decimal;\"><li><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\"><b>Two liens per case must be signed. <a href=\"https://precise.radflow360.com/\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">E-sign all liens instantly</a>.&nbsp;</b></span><ol data-front-editor-list style=\"margin-top: 0px; margin-bottom: 0px; list-style-type: lower-alpha;\"><li><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\"><b>One for the images and&nbsp;</b></span></li><li><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\"><b>One for the radiologist report</b></span></li></ol></li><li><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\"><b><a href=\"https://precise.radflow360.com/\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">Submit </a>a negotiation offer for your client's bill.</b></span><ol data-front-editor-list style=\"margin-top: 0px; margin-bottom: 0px; list-style-type: lower-alpha;\"><li><b>Payments submitted without an accepted negotiation offer will be rejected and returned to sender.</b></li></ol></li><li><b>Pay <a href=\"https://precise.radflow360.com/\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">online via credit card, ACH</a> or mail a check.</b></li></ol><div><span style=\"font-weight: 700;\"><br /></span></div><div><span style=\"font-weight: 700;\">Thank you for your cooperation to ensure a speedy turnaround time for your client and our patient.<br /></span></div><div><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\"><b><br /></b></span></div><div><span style><span style=\"font-size: 14px; font-weight: bold;\">To submit a </span><span style=\"font-weight: 700;\">negotiation</span><span style=\"font-size: 14px; font-weight: bold;\">, please email <a href=\"mailto:offer@precisemri.com\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">offer@precisemri.com</a>&nbsp;or <a href=\"https://precise.radflow360.com/\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">submit online via the attorney portal</a></span></span></div><div><span style><span style=\"font-size: 14px; font-weight: bold;\"><br /></span></span></div><div><span style><span style=\"font-size: 14px; font-weight: bold;\">If you are requesting reports, records or images and to avoid any delays, please access the attorney portal @ <a href=\"http://www.precise.radflow360.com/\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">www.Precise.RadFlow360.com</a><a href=\"https://precise.radflow360.com/\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">https://precise.radflow360.com/</a></span></span></div><div><span style=\"font-family: 'Helvetica Neue', 'Segoe UI', Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 13px; font-weight: 400;\"><br /></span></div><div><span style=\"font-size: 13px;\">Thank you!</span></div>",
      "text": "**This is an automated reply confirming we received your email/request.**\n\n\nAccess our new attorney portal to e-sign liens, view bills, balances, reports, images and pay online @ Precise.RadFlow360.com\n\n\nPlease allow three full business days for a response. (Business hours: Mon-Fri 9am-5pm).\n\n\nIf you do not receive a response within the allotted time, please call to follow up on your email/request. \n\n\nNew address for mailing payments:\n\n\nPrecise Imaging\nPO Box 510626\nLivonia MI 48151\n\n\n\nIMPORTANT INFO BEFORE SUBMITTING PAYMENT\n\n\n\nTwo liens per case must be signed. E-sign all liens instantly. \nOne for the images and \n\nOne for the radiologist report\n\n\n\nSubmit a negotiation offer for your client's bill.\nPayments submitted without an accepted negotiation offer will be rejected and returned to sender.\n\n\n\nPay online via credit card, ACH or mail a check.\n\n\n\nThank you for your cooperation to ensure a speedy turnaround time for your client and our patient.\n\n\n\nTo submit a negotiation, please email offer@precisemri.com or submit online via the attorney portal\n\n\nIf you are requesting reports, records or images and to avoid any delays, please access the attorney portal @ www.Precise.RadFlow360.comhttps://precise.radflow360.com/\n\n\nThank you!",
